Z||000005||biggdaddy||08-21-99||12:11 PM||||Dark, I`m in the process of putting a Montreal area Fiero club together, It will be open to anybody at all, With next to nothing to pay!  Later on, if it gets big and there`s need for more $$$ we`ll take care of it accordingly.  A member`s parts catalog, various events for the public and for members, shows, rally, maybe even club races! (We have some great tracks around here!) I`m sure that we could find some local GM dealerships or garages that will sponser the club or give discounts to members.  Interested in helping out? Just e-mail me!  A website would be cool but I have yet to find a computer wizz that likes fiero`s too.
